    "collapsible_tabs_3L6UTG": {
      "type": "collapsible-tabs",
      "blocks": {
        "1655868348d34715f4-0": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "How does it work?",
            "content": "<p>With our Wine Club, you can select the wine type you enjoy most, and we deliver a carefully curated 6 or 12 bottle case right to your door, 4 times a year. You can even gift a membership too.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": true
          }
        },
        "1655868348d34715f4-1": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "How much does it cost?",
            "content": "<p>Prices start at £135 per quarter for our special white wine selection. Plus, we guarantee that we’ll always send you wines which are more valuable than the price you pay.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "9891166a-7648-4555-84e2-cfb0e9832a21": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "What are the other benefits to being a member?",
            "content": "<p>You'll receive online discounts, free delivery and exclusive invitations to our member-only events. You can even gift a membership too.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "content_tzBhRU": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "How do I gift a membership?",
            "content": "<p>It’s really easy – just choose who it’s for when you go through the checkout process, and enter their delivery address (if it’s different from yours). You can add a gift note too of course.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "content_nWKgmk": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "When does the first delivery arrive?",
            "content": "<p>We’ll deliver your first selection straight after you’ve signed up. You will then get notified 3 days before your next quarterly shipment is due to be dispatched.  </p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "content_x73fwe": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "What if I want to change my case?",
            "content": "<p>It’s no problem, just log into your account and ‘Swap this for a different product’.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "content_ekm8tw": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Can I cancel my subscription?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, your membership is completely flexible. If you log into your account, you can click on ‘Cancel my subscription’</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        }
      },
