    "collapsible_tabs_6FraBE": {
      "type": "collapsible-tabs",
      "blocks": {
        "content_XUBiFc": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Do you send physical tickets or will I receive an e-ticket?",
            "content": "<p>We do not send out physical tickets for our events. Instead, an email confirming registration will be sent to the person who has purchased the ticket(s), and this email can be used as confirmation when you arrive at the event.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": true
          }
        },
        "content_FTpbU4": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "I’ve purchased an event as a gift. Is there anything I need to do?",
            "content": "<p>Please email us at <a href=\"https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/?fs=1&tf=cm&source=mailto&to=events@kiwicru.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/?fs=1&tf=cm&source=mailto&to=events@kiwicru.com\">events@kiwicru.com</a> with the name and date of the event, along with the name, telephone number and email address of the recipient. This is so we can contact them directly with the event details.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "content_RNGrf4": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "I’ve included a gift message. How will this be delivered?",
            "content": "<p>If you’d like a gift note to be sent out, please contact us at <a href=\"https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/?fs=1&tf=cm&source=mailto&to=events@kiwicru.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/?fs=1&tf=cm&source=mailto&to=events@kiwicru.com\">events@kiwicru.com</a> with the name and date of the event, along with the name, telephone number and email address of the recipient, and any special message you’d like to include.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "content_MRqLGQ": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Do I need to know lots about wine to attend?",
            "content": "<p>Absolutely not! Our events are designed for a range of experience and knowledge levels, which we try to make this clear on our event pages. If you’re unsure if an event is for you, simply email us at <a href=\"https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/?fs=1&tf=cm&source=mailto&to=events@kiwicru.com\" title=\"https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/?fs=1&tf=cm&source=mailto&to=events@kiwicru.com\">events@kiwicru.com</a> or call us on 07908 210 953 and we will try to help. There is something for everybody!</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "content_8A4hgm": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Can I join a waiting list for sold out events?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, of course, please go ahead and join our waiting lists for sold out events. People do drop out from time to time. If tickets become available, we will contact you.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "content_KfJUBH": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Something’s come up – what’s the latest I can cancel and get a refund?",
            "content": "<p>If you wish to cancel a ticket that you have purchased for an event, please contact us as soon as possible at <a href=\"https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/?fs=1&tf=cm&source=mailto&to=events@kiwicru.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/?fs=1&tf=cm&source=mailto&to=events@kiwicru.com\">events@kiwicru.com</a>. If you cancel your ticket at least 14 days before the date of the event a full refund will be arranged.</p><p>If you cancel your ticket later than 14 days before the date of the event, we will try to find another buyer for your ticket. If we are able to re-sell your ticket, a full refund will be arranged. If we are not able to re-sell your ticket, we will not be able to issue be a refund (but you may still attend the event, if you change your mind).</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        }
      },
