    "collapsible_tabs_pwDJUR": {
      "type": "collapsible-tabs",
      "blocks": {
        "content_HECwAy": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Who are they for?",
            "content": "<p>A private wine tasting event is a perfect way to celebrate a special occasion or birthday, or simply to entertain or spend time with friends? It’s also a very successful format for team bonding with work colleagues, or as a ‘thank-you’ to clients.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": true
          }
        },
        "content_39E4PG": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "How many people can I invite?",
            "content": "<p>That’s partly dependent on the venue and partly dependent on the style of event, eg is it a sit-down tutored tasting, a more casual walk around, type of experience, or is it basically just a party?! There’s something which will fit every occasion, and almost any number of people, so please get in touch to <a href=\"https://www.kiwicru.com/pages/corporate-private-events\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.kiwicru.com/pages/corporate-private-events\">find out more</a></p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "content_JTiPXL": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Where are they held?",
            "content": "<p>Private wine tasting events can be hosted at your home, your office, our own venue, or at a location of your choice - we can recommend London venues to suit any party size or budget. We can also organise, if required, venues that include canapes or dinner cooked by top local chefs.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "content_BGRYYk": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "How much do they cost?",
            "content": "<p>Every event is different, and so coming up with a cost is tricky. So much depends in the type of venue, number of guests, number of wines, whether there’s food. You get the idea! The best thing is to have a chat with us and we’ll explore what you have in mind and what’s possible. Please contact us at <a href=\"https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/?fs=1&tf=cm&source=mailto&to=hello@kiwicru.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/?fs=1&tf=cm&source=mailto&to=hello@kiwicru.com\">hello@kiwicru.com</a> or call us on 07908 210 953 or use the form on our <a href=\"https://www.kiwicru.com/pages/contact\" title=\"https://www.kiwicru.com/pages/contact\">Contact Us </a>page. </p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        }
      },
