    "collapsible_tabs_nUHE6k": {
      "type": "collapsible-tabs",
      "blocks": {
        "content_JejbL7": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Can I use a discount code on sale items?",
            "content": "<p>No, discount codes apply to full-priced items only and cannot used on sale items </p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "content_WPMQYm": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "I made a mistake with my order - can I amend it?",
            "content": "<p>If you contact us as soon as you realise you’d like to amend your order, and it has not been dispatched, we will amend it. Please contact us at <a href=\"https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/?fs=1&tf=cm&source=mailto&to=hello@kiwicru.com\" title=\"https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/?fs=1&tf=cm&source=mailto&to=hello@kiwicru.com\">hello@kiwicru.com</a> or call us on 07908 210 953 or use the form on our <a href=\"/pages/contact\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact\">Contact Us</a> page.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": true
          }
        },
        "content_EJ3yig": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Where do you deliver to?",
            "content": "<p>We distribute our wines throughout the UK Mainland (England, Wales, Scottish Borders and Central Scotland).</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "content_pm7r9C": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "How long will my order take to arrive?",
            "content": "<p>Delivery will be made as soon as possible after your order is accepted (and is usually dispatched 2-4 working days from the date we receive your order)</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "content_KEdjpL": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "What are the delivery times?",
            "content": "<p>Our courier is Evermile, and will normally deliver between 8am and 6pm, Monday to Friday. We are currently not able to offer weekend deliveries.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "content_njbrpW": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Do I have to be in when it arrives?",
            "content": "<p>No, you will receive updates from Evermile throughout your delivery, with the option to pick time slots and different days, and preferred places to leave your delivery, should you not intend to be present to sign for it when it arrives.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "content_e9gLWM": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Can I request delivery on a specific day?",
            "content": "<p>You can arrange this with Evermile, once they have made contact to tell you it’s on its way.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "content_6FjPwF": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "I’ve received the wrong wine – what do I do?",
            "content": "<p>In the unlikely event of you receiving the wrong wine in your order we will arrange to exchange any mis-delivered products as soon as possible. Please get in touch with us straight away at <a href=\"https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/?fs=1&tf=cm&source=mailto&to=hello@kiwicru.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/?fs=1&tf=cm&source=mailto&to=hello@kiwicru.com\">hello@kiwicru.com </a>or call us on 07908 210 953 or use the form on our <a href=\"/pages/contact\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact\">Contact Us</a> page.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "content_gJmEBV": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "My delivery is damaged – what happens next?",
            "content": "<p>If your order has been damaged in transit, please get in touch straight away at <a href=\"https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/?fs=1&tf=cm&source=mailto&to=hello@kiwicru.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/?fs=1&tf=cm&source=mailto&to=hello@kiwicru.com\">hello@kiwicru.com</a> or call us on 07908 210 953 or use the form on our <a href=\"/pages/contact\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact\">Contact Us</a> page and we can make the necessary arrangements to replace any damaged bottles.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        }
      },
